{
  "slug": "grits",
  "name": "Grits",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agentic PM & OKR for Claude Code. Auto-track tasks from code changes, align work to OKR, and get smart next-task recommendations. Hooks auto-register work when you edit files. Skills (/grits:start, /grits:done) guide the full workflow. 28 MCP tools for task management, project tracking, and OKR alignment.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `done` (Complete current work: verify → commit → update Grits → suggest next), `grits-loop` (Use when you want Claude Code to autonomously advance a Grits project's tasks through their kanban states (todo…), `start` (Check next tasks → select → write description → start), `workflow` (Grits workflow guide for AI agents)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `grits`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install grits@claude-community` from `gritive/grits-agent`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "mcp": 1
  },
